        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Fork and Spoon Appliance Pulls Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCast in solid brass, these original design door pulls are a popular choice for refrigerators, freezers, or other appliance doors. These 12\" high Fork and Spoon pulls are from the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. They are sure to be a hit at your next gathering after you install them on your Sub Zero refrigerator and  freezer.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Fork and Spoon Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Width of Fork Pull: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Width of Spoon Pull: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 7-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Set - 1 Fork Pull and 1 Spoon Pull</i>\r\n</p>",
